sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin User
    participant Console as Next.js Admin App
    participant API as Admin API Endpoint
    participant AuditLog as admin_audit_events DB Table

    Admin->>Console: Suspend User Account (Reason: Spam Abuse)
    Console->>API: POST /api/v1/admin/users/:id/restrict
    API->>API: Verify Admin RBAC Role & MFA Token
    API->>AuditLog: Write Immutable Audit Record (Actor, Action, Target, IP, Reason)
    API-->>Console: Action Success & Audit Recorded
